    "title": "Highway 78 reopens near Ladson Road after single-vehicle incident - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Colt Yeargin ,\n6 hours ago\nCHARLESTON COUNTY, S.C. (WCSC) — Two lanes of Highway 78 at Ladson Road have reopened toward Summerville following a single-vehicle incident, according to the Charleston County Sheriff’s Office. The sheriff’s office said the roadway reopened around 7:30 p.m. Officials did not provide additional details about the incident.\nRead full article\nAdd to Preferred Sources\n3",
